      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.4-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ২.** $(x^2 + 2)$ কে $(x + 1)$ দ্বারা গুণ করলে গুণফল কত?",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(x^2 + 2)",
        "(x + 1)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 46,
      "pdfPageEnd": 46,
      "printedPageStart": 41,
      "printedPageEnd": 41,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.4-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এখানে $(x^2 + 2)$ এবং $(x + 1)$ বহুপদী দুটির গুণফল $(x^2 + 2)(x + 1) = x^3 + x^2 + 2x + 2$ একটি বহুপদী যার মাত্রা $2 + 1 = 3$ এবং মুখ্যসহগ $1 \\times 1 = 1$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(x^2 + 2)",
        "(x + 1)",
        "(x^2 + 2)(x + 1) = x^3 + x^2 + 2x + 2",
        "2 + 1 = 3",
        "1 \\times 1 = 1"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 46,
      "pdfPageEnd": 46,
      "printedPageStart": 41,
      "printedPageEnd": 41,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.4-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৩.** $(x^2 + 1)(x - 6)$কে $2x^2 + 3$ দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগফল কত?",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(x^2 + 1)(x - 6)",
        "2x^2 + 3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 46,
      "pdfPageEnd": 46,
      "printedPageStart": 41,
      "printedPageEnd": 41,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.4-p005",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এখানে ভাজ্য $P(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x - 6) = x^3 - 6x^2 + x - 6$ এর মাত্রা ৩ এবং মুখ্যসহগ ১।\nআর ভাজক $Q(x) = 2x^2 + 3$ এর মাত্রা ২ এবং মুখ্যসহগ ২।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "P(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x - 6) = x^3 - 6x^2 + x - 6",
        "Q(x) = 2x^2 + 3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 46,
      "pdfPageEnd": 46,
      "printedPageStart": 41,
      "printedPageEnd": 41,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.4-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$P(x)$ কে $Q(x)$ দিয়ে ভাগ করলে, ভাগফল $F(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x - 3$ এবং ভাগশেষ $R(x) = -\\frac{x}{2} + 3$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "P(x)",
        "Q(x)",
        "F(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x - 3",
        "R(x) = -\\frac{x}{2} + 3"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 46,
      "pdfPageEnd": 46,
      "printedPageStart": 41,
      "printedPageEnd": 41,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.4-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "কাজেই, ভাগফল $F(x)$ একটি বহুপদী যার মাত্রা $3 - 2 = 1$ এবং মুখ্যসহগ $\\frac{1}{2}$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "F(x)",
        "3 - 2 = 1",
        "\\frac{1}{2}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 46,
      "pdfPageEnd": 46,
